EFF Short Wordlist #1

The vocabulary in src/core/id-words.ts is adapted from EFF Short Wordlist #1
by the Electronic Frontier Foundation (EFF).

Source: https://www.eff.org/files/2016/09/08/eff_short_wordlist_1.txt
Source SHA-256: 8f5ca830b8bffb6fe39c9736c024a00a6a6411adb3f83a9be8bfeeb6e067ae69
