https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/
EFF license statement: https://github.com/EFForg/eff_diceware#license

Modifications: omitted dice-number columns and removed "yo-yo" (contains
the ID delimiter) and "grope" (inappropriate for generated identifiers).
The remaining 1,294 words retain the source order and spelling.
The vocabulary has not been validated against speech-recognition systems.
